  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary Assisted Return Programme 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme supports migrants willing to return voluntarily to their Country of Origin (CoO) and contributes to improve return migration management in Norway. It will be based on the already existing Voluntary Assisted Return Programme framework and complementary activities offered. The programme is open to interational protection applications, to applicants whose international protection request was rejected, migrants in an irregular situation in Norway and to migrants with a legal residency in Norway who want to return voluntarily to their CoO.</narrative>
  </description>
